  "rationale": "The plant automaton G1 models the robot's combined perception and motion capability, including all possible sensor outcomes and motion commands. The specification automata E1-E4 encode safe, progress-oriented exploration: E1 binds clear perception to forward/random_walk actions, E2 and E3 bind left/right obstacle detections to directed turns, and E4 enforces conservative recovery for front obstacles with a brief backward escape, then a turn, before resuming exploration. All transitions are deterministic, and recovery states are one-shot. The design maximizes safe coverage while ensuring obstacle avoidance and rapid return to exploration.",
